   "end_sec": 27.525,
   "duration_sec": 9.155
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C55-D004",
   "turn_index": 3,
   "speaker": "佐藤",
   "source_text": "はい。また、毎回長く使ったかどうかは判断できません。試行週の平均時間は不明です。担当者の人数も確認するべきです。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C55-D004-1",
    "C55-D004-2",
    "C55-D004-3",
    "C55-D004-4"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-10",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 27.875,
   "end_sec": 37.923,
   "duration_sec": 10.048
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C55-D005",
   "turn_index": 4,
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "source_text": "希望する人さえ多ければ、始められますか。それなら、参加しなかった人にも聞きたいです。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C55-D005-1",
    "C55-D005-2"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-5",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 38.273,
   "end_sec": 44.639,
   "duration_sec": 6.366
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C55-D006",
   "turn_index": 5,
   "speaker": "佐藤",
   "source_text": "希望だけでは決められません。たとえ希望が多くても、安全の確認を省くわけにはいきません。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C55-D006-1",
    "C55-D006-2"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-10",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
